{'symbol': 'MSCI', 'date': '2022-07-19 14:30:00', 'title': 'MSCI ANNOUNCES TIME CHANGE FOR ITS EARNINGS CALL TO REVIEW SECOND QUARTER 2022 RESULTS', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MSCI INC. (NYSE: MSCI), A LEADING PROVIDER OF CRITICAL DECISION SUPPORT TOOLS AND SERVICES FOR THE GLOBAL INVESTMENT COMMUNITY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS CHANGED THE TIMING OF ITS PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED EARNINGS CONFERENCE CALL. MSCI'S SENIOR MANAGEMENT WILL NOW REVIEW SECOND QUARTER 2022 RESULTS ON TUESDAY, JULY 26, 2022 AT 10:30 AM EASTERN TIME. FINANCIAL RESULTS WILL BE ANNOUNCED ON TUESDAY, JULY 26, 2022, BEFORE THE MARKET OPENS. THERE WILL BE NO CHANGE TO WEBCAST"}